        <nav aria-label="面包屑导航" class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-brand-dark/50">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">首页</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-brand-dark/80 font-medium">万字机场 FAQ 百科</span>
        </nav>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-accent/30 bg-brand-accent/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-accent mb-4">
          <span>GEO 深度知识库 · 万字避坑指南</span>
        </div>
