              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-brand-dark/70">限时专属 9 折码：</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-brand-accent select-all">AMM</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
