            <p class="text-xs text-brand-dark/70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              查阅我们的全套指南矩阵，获取客户端安装包或了解最新暴雷预警：
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <a href="/clients/" class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-brand-page p-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark hover:bg-brand-accent/5">
                <span>💻 客户端官方与开源下载大全</span>
                <span>→</span>
              </a>
              <a href="/warning/" class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-brand-page p-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-brand-dark hover:bg-brand-accent/5">
